Value UPTIME ((\d+\s\w+.s.,?\s?){1,4})
Value BIOS (\S+)
Value OS (\S+)
Value PLATFORM ([\w-]+)
Value HOSTNAME (.+)
Value SERIAL (\w+)

Start
  ^\s+BIOS:\s+version\s+${BIOS}\s*$$
  ^\s+NXOS:\s+version\s+${OS}\s*$$
  ^\s+system:\s+version\s+${OS}\s*$$
  ^\s+cisco\s+Nexus\d+\s+${PLATFORM}
  ^\s+cisco\s+${PLATFORM}\s+[cC]hassis
  ^\s+cisco\s+Nexus\s+${PLATFORM}\s+[cC]hassis
  ^\s+Device\s+name:\s+${HOSTNAME}$$
  ^\s+Processor\s+[Bb]oard\s+ID\s+${SERIAL}$$
  ^Kernel\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME} -> Record
  ^.*$$
